# 16. 볼륨 백업 / 복원 (2026-11-20 18:29:19 KST)

## 1) 백업 대상 확인 (6.9 에서 만든 codyssey-data)

$ docker run --rm -v codyssey-data:/data ubuntu:22.04 ls -l /data
total 4
-rw-r--r-- 1 root root 52 Nov 19 06:15 hello.txt

$ docker run --rm -v codyssey-data:/data ubuntu:22.04 cat /data/hello.txt
persisted at 2026-11-19T06:15:07Z from dcdaa81d579c

## 2) 백업: 임시 컨테이너가 볼륨(/data)과 호스트 폴더(/backup)를 동시에 마운트하고 tar 로 묶음

$ docker run --rm -v codyssey-data:/data:ro -v "$(pwd)/backups":/backup ubuntu:22.04 tar czf /backup/codyssey-data.tar.gz -C /data .

$ ls -l backups/
total 8
-rw-r--r--  1 sin-uilyeong  staff  195 Nov 20 18:29 codyssey-data.tar.gz

$ tar tzvf backups/codyssey-data.tar.gz
drwxr-xr-x  0 root   root        0 Nov 19 15:15 ./
-rw-r--r--  0 root   root       52 Nov 19 15:15 ./hello.txt

## 3) 복원: 새 볼륨을 만들고 tar 를 풀어 넣음

$ docker volume create codyssey-data-restored
codyssey-data-restored

$ docker run --rm -v codyssey-data-restored:/data -v "$(pwd)/backups":/backup:ro ubuntu:22.04 tar xzf /backup/codyssey-data.tar.gz -C /data

## 4) 검증: 복원된 볼륨에 원본과 같은 내용이 있는지

$ docker run --rm -v codyssey-data-restored:/data ubuntu:22.04 cat /data/hello.txt
persisted at 2026-11-19T06:15:07Z from dcdaa81d579c

$ diff <(docker run --rm -v codyssey-data:/data ubuntu:22.04 sha256sum /data/hello.txt) <(docker run --rm -v codyssey-data-restored:/data ubuntu:22.04 sha256sum /data/hello.txt) && echo '원본 = 복원본 (sha256 일치)'
원본 = 복원본 (sha256 일치)

$ docker volume ls
DRIVER    VOLUME NAME
local     codyssey-data
local     codyssey-data-restored

